    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but it doesn't feel temporary. it feels more like a finality. like the version of me that actually mattered, the one that had purpose and value, is just... dead. it's like being a shell for someone who isn't there anymore. why keep going through the motions when the person who started this journey is already gone?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
